  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Festa 2015 was held at four venues in November 2015: Hiroshima on 3 November, Pacifico Yokohama on 7 and 8 November, Intex Osaka on 15 November and Nagoya's Fukiage Hall on 29 November, and every visitor got an original holo Pikachu. Its Victory Battle was played with cards from the Black & White series on, in a morning and an afternoon session whose top finishers met in a playoff. A win earned a Max Potion, and the top three of each league in the playoff won Victory Ring in gold, silver or bronze.",
